Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:04.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa, can I have your autograph while I have the chance? {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What doting parents. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:09.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Same thing will happen to you once you have a daughter, too. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I swear it won't. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can see you having one, {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,since you are very much like Dad. {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:17.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What? Me and him?! {S1 ep21}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:19.92,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Two months, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, it's been two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:23.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You will have the baby, right? {ep14}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's a piece of work, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:28.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:34.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun will be there for me, so I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:37.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We worked together until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:40.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,He looks just like you on that day, Akio-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:48.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,When I had Nagisa in my stomach, you said that you'd protect her. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I did, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:54.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Good luck, you bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:56.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Bum..."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:59.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I'm not allowed to be one anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:02.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa will probably have to take a break from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:06.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll have to support three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is where the trial for my family begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:12.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A thought crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:18.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did my old man think the same thing before I was born?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:43.63,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
