Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:52.74,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:53.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:56.49,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I heard you had a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:57.29,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:59.20,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Your wife had a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:02.75,Default,John,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mr. Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's not born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:08.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san, who did you hear it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.18,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,My wife heard it from Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.84,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everyone in the neighborhood knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:16.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To be feared: the power of neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:19.68,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You've still got a way to go as a member of society,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:23.10,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,but now you'll have to act like\Na real husband no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:26.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah... but it doesn't feel real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:30.11,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You'll feel that no matter what once the baby's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:34.11,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,No one in this world can live alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:39.12,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everyone lives by supporting\Nand being supported by others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:37.83,Default-alt,Guy,0,0,0,,There he goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:43.83,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It's been 4.5 billion years since the Earth was formed in this vast universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:46.25,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 15
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:46.25,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}In the Remains of Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:49.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The days started to move at an amazing speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:55.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fs81}By the time she entered the third month, the pregnancy sickness worsened and Nagisa spent most days in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:59.43,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:03.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry; I can take care of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're supposed to do this together, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you eat at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:14.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't eat much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Isn't there any way to make this a little easier for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:21.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's not even known why pregnancy sickness happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:26.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Drinking water only makes me sick, so I take these to get water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:36.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:54.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Did I wake you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:55.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm feeling all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:01.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You should eat some, even a little, while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Did you make these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not used to it, so the shape is a little... you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:14.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. I'll have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:22.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,While the days went flying by,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:31.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa and I were restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:36.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is it all right for you to be up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:38.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I feel very good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:43.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The doctor said that things will stabilize around the tenth week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,He was exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Must mean it's growing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:55.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, I have something I wanted to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Give birth at home?
