Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:01.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I want to give birth to the baby here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:03.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can you even do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:08.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I got this pamphlet for a maternity class yesterday at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:12.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There's a page by a mother who gave birth at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:18.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So the father gives the first bath, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:23.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,At a hospital, there are cases where you can't hold the baby immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:26.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I would like to be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is your and my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:41.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to give birth to the baby in our home. In this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.89,0:06:43.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:48.56,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Give birth at home?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How was that drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about you turn off the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:05.08,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You know, giving birth is hard enough,\N{\i1}and{\i0\fscx30} {\r} you're gonna try to pull it off at your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:08.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The doctor is worried about Nagisa's health,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but I want to fulfill Nagisa's wishes as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That said, of course it's a question of how well she is at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:20.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're right. Having a safe delivery is the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:26.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,But when I gave birth to Nagisa, I was soon separated from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:31.98,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san held Nagisa after the doctors, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:34.73,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But I was the first one to lick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.73,0:07:37.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You licked me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.11,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You were that cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't do such a thing even if I was cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:45.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:47.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you agree to giving birth at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If there's nothing to worry about, physically, then why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:53.83,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Make sure you give the first hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:55.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:58.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll be the first to lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:08:02.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. Tomoya-kun also gets the first lick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I won't be licking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:06.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ah, right. He won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What a stupid family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is Yagi-san. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:18.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,She is my friend and works as a midwife. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:20.61,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,I'm Yagi. Nice to meet you. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:22.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm Okazaki Nagisa. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm her husband, Tomoya. {ep 14}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:29.99,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,I was told you were looking into delivering the baby here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:30.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:33.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can it be done in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:36.29,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,What's important is to be in a place where you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.63,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:41.63,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Please take the time to think things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.80,Default,2,0,0,0,,We'll be in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.39,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,If anything happens, please let me know any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:51.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:55.98,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yagi-san knows that Nagisa has a weak body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.98,0:09:01.53,Default,San,0,0,0,,{\fs75.6}If those around worry about it too much, the mother becomes uneasy, too, so I was told to be mindful of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:02.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:11.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What were you talking about with Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:14.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Um... Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:19.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You don't need to hide it; it was about my health, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:25.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I know how you, Mom, and Dad are all worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:28.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But, even if the worst happens to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:30.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to give birth to the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:35.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.14,0:09:38.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're all working so you have a safe delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:43.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Doesn't this remind you of our high school days?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.07,0:09:53.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Remember how we all worked together to make the stage a success?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I just thought that it's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:06.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Can you tell? I'm your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:10.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't tell lies like that; the baby will believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:13.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Your kid can't even take a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:16.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's Nagisa's baby, so it probably can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:18.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:20.52,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:24.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,Apparently Akio-san wants to be called "Akki".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:26.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Akki. I'm Akki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.90,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Quit the prenatal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:33.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,The ears are there by this time,\Nand it can hear the sounds from the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:36.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,so it's good to let it listen to music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm always singing songs to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:46.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:50.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:57.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:11:01.65,Default,All,0,0,0,,Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:08.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought everything was going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:11.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Or, perhaps somewhere in my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:14.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was eagerly anticipating that day coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:18.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I just got a little sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.54,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa called in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:28.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,I rushed over, and Nagisa was on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:31.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then you could have told me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:35.05,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry; I didn't want to disturb you at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:38.43,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Please don't worry; the baby's well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.27,0:11:40.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:45.27,Default,Yag,0,0,0,,Call me at any time anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:49.78,Default,San,0,0,0,,To be on the safe side, I'll be with Nagisa during the day from tomorrow on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:52.53,Default,San,0,0,0,,That way you'll rest easy, right, Tomoya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:54.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How are you feeling? Is there anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:06.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't need anything.\NI'm at ease when you're by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course. Since you're strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:18.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't worry, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:21.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:27.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can make it through if we're together, since I'm being protected by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:38.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was no longer able to relax in the blessed feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:49.92,Default,San,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.30,Default,San,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,So this is where Nagisa was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.76,Default,San,0,0,0,,I wanted to come here once, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:02.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's a very trendy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:04.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No one uses that word nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:06.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:15.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,I have something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:16.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.82,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's about Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:26.58,Default,San,0,0,0,,I was told by the doctor that there will be some danger during the delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.88,Default,San,0,0,0,,I have not told this to Nagisa yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,Only I've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.09,0:13:39.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Exactly how much danger is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't say even Nagisa's life is at...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:48.77,Default,San,0,0,0,,The stress to the mother will be greater than an average delivery's,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:52.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,but there shouldn't be any problem with the delivery itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:53.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:57.57,Default,San,0,0,0,,However that's if everything goes well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:02.74,Default,San,0,0,0,,As you know, Nagisa falls ill from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:06.87,Default,San,0,0,0,,There are many mysterious aspects to Nagisa's illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:11.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,and the doctors are worried about the worst-case scenario, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:17.38,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is something that needs to be thought through carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:21.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to tell you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:28.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,You should tell Nagisa, and both of you should go listen to what the doctor has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:32.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,After that, let's all think together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:36.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If we think of the worst-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:39.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,should we give up on having the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.07,0:14:42.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,I cannot answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,But, if that's the choice to make, then the sooner the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.50,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please think it through carefully with Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:56.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san, as always, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,We're a family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.43,0:15:05.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to have the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:07.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew you would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:13.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I am a weak person, but I don't want to give up on the baby because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:18.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If it's to have the baby, then I don't mind giving up on delivering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:24.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to meet the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They said the risk would go down if she delivered at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I'm still worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.55,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa didn't change her mind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.55,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\an5\blur1\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs108\c&H4E555C&\frz5.889\pos(1062,240)}Food good to eat during Pregnancy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.55,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs108\c&H4E555C&\frz2.589\pos(1087.5,559.5)}Iron - Egg  Oyster  Clam  Liver
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:46.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think in her heart, she's scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:50.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's acting cheerful, but I think she may be feeling the same things as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.53,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:12.71,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.96,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This is my secret playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:21.97,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I play baseball with kids or sit and do nothing here a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:26.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I noticed you went missing during work a lot, so this is where you were, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.97,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs48\blur1\b1\c&H9C8A88&\frz-16.54\fax0.33\pos(815.7,589.2)}Hikarizaka General Hospital \NConstruction Site
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The trees and bushes got torn down one after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:29.81,Default-alt,Kids,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:32.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...and apparently a hospital's going to be built here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:31.93,Default-alt,Kids,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:33.94,Default-alt,Kid,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.90,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This is the continuation of something I told you two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:47.87,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's when I was still in theater and Sanae was a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:54.00,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,As I told you, Nagisa was always alone back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:17:00.04,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That day, Sanae and I left for work, leaving the sick Nagisa at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:04.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We both couldn't skip work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:10.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa's condition looked stable, and both Sanae and I were planning to come home right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.85,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa was outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.85,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She was waiting until she collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:21.36,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,By the time morning came,\Nit looked like there was no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:24.86,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I never went through anything that sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:30.07,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This will be the first time I've told the story from this point on to anyone but Sanae.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:35.12,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Before I realized it, I was running with Nagisa in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:40.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I was running aimlessly, and I ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.59,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I prayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:46.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Please save Nagisa."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.55,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"I don't want an ending like this."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:52.60,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All I could do was pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:18:01.27,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Right then, it felt like the plants here covered Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I thought I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:14.04,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But it was reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:18.46,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Tears overwhelmed me,\Nand I thanked everything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:23.09,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I've been looking after this place ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:27.51,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but to think of this place as Nagisa's double.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:29.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Strange story, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.93,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But it really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:34.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:40.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's impossible for all wishes to come true if you pray for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:47.28,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But if you think and put your best effort forth until the end, then the outcome can't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:51.36,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you to have the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm saying leave the judgment to the one who goes through the most pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:57.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,and we'll just accept the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:58.83,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:01.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Or rather, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:05.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm sure there will be lots of hardships and painful stuff waiting for you ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You guys can...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:10.93,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We can overcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.01,0:19:13.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.93,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We're a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:19.18,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We're going to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:32.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The wind feels nice and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:37.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It just moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:38.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:42.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It felt like I was rubbed from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How about we come up with a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:03.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. We'll need one if it's a boy and another if it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:07.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How about we use one character from your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:12.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, rather than that, let's think of\Nsomething from your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:14.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can pass on the last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:19.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But it's difficult to use my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:22.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'd become like Nagisako or Nagisami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:24.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't have to use it literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:27.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something that traces back to Nagisa should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:31.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:36.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How does Ushio sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:37.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:43.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. It's about how the tide rises and goes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:46.56,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fax0.1\fs180\frz7.486\c&H91BEE7&\pos(555,136.5)}Ushio
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:50.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If it's this, it can be used for a boy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okazaki Ushio, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.95,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs144\frz352.621\pos(541.5,582)\c&H80BAEE&}Okazaki Ushio
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.91,0:21:01.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure a lot will happen within a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:05.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But as time passes, things will return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:10.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That will continue, and I will watch over Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:14.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rather than a "nagisa", a bay, "ushio" is more grand, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:16.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:17.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Since it's the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:25.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will it be able to grow up to be someone with the kindness to embrace and nurture anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:26.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I hope it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We couldn't go to the beach again this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:33.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.07,0:21:37.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I wanted to see the ocean with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:39.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then let's make a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:40.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:44.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Next year, we'll go to the beach with Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:45.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:47.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,A promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:55.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You will promise to, won't you, Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:21:59.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.89,0:22:08.40,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(0,500)\an5\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs144\c&H80BAEE&\frz20.029\pos(673.5,709.5)}Okazaki Ushio
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:09.90,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:26.33,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:26.33,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:33.38,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:33.38,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:41.43,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:41.43,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.43,0:22:48.52,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.43,0:22:48.52,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:55.82,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:55.82,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:23:04.45,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:23:04.45,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:12.04,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:12.04,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:19.59,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:19.59,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.59,0:23:27.14,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.59,0:23:27.14,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:34.65,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:34.65,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:39.90,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.65,0:23:39.90,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.90,0:23:43.36,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:46.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,There may be more than one hidden world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:50.37,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,There's a theory of multiple worlds existing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:55.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I remember you saying something like that when you were talking about fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.88,0:24:01.13,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes. There is no one future,\Nbut there are many possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:03.26,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I still think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.80,0:24:09.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 16
